{"id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#cor:forward-difference-maximum-product","title":"cor:forward-difference-maximum-product","path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.md","line":1306,"body":"","kind":"theorem","status":"not_started","tex":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex#cor:forward-difference-maximum-product","uses":["[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:forward-difference-quotient]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:max-function-continuous-product]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:forward-difference-maximum-product]]","[[references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:forward-difference-quotient]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex","label":"cor:forward-difference-maximum-product","line":2018,"source":"\\begin{corollary}[Forward difference maximum property, product case]\n\\label{cor:forward-difference-maximum-product}\n\n\\uses{def:forward-difference-quotient}\n\n\n\nLet $X$ be nonempty and compact, and let $F,F'$ be continuous on\n$X\\times\\Ar$, with $\\partial_sF(x,s)=F'(x,s)$. Suppose\n$$F'(x,t)\\le\\psi(t,F_{\\max}(t))$$\nwhenever $x$ maximizes $F(\\cdot,t)$, where\n$\\psi\\in C^1([a,b]\\times\\Ar)$. If $G'=\\psi(t,G)$ and\n$F_{\\max}(a)\\le G(a)$, then $F_{\\max}(t)\\le G(t)$ on $[a,b]$.\n\\end{corollary}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch\n\n\\uses{lem:max-function-continuous-product,lem:forward-difference-maximum-product,lem:forward-difference-quotient}\nThe preceding lemmas give continuity of $F_{\\max}$ and its required\nforward quotient bound. Apply\nLemma~\\ref{lem:forward-difference-quotient}.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Corollary</div></section>[Forward difference maximum property, product case] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-636f723a666f72776172642d646966666572656e63652d6d6178696d756d2d70726f64756374\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23def%3Aforward-difference-quotient\">↗ def:forward-difference-quotient</a> <p></p>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X$\">$X$</span> be nonempty and compact, and let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F,F&#x27;$\">$F,F&#x27;$</span> be continuous on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X\\times \\Ar $\">$X\\times \\Ar $</span>, with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\partial _sF(x,s)=F&#x27;(x,s)$\">$\\partial _sF(x,s)=F&#x27;(x,s)$</span>. Suppose <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\[ F&#x27;(x,t)\\le \\psi (t,F_{\\max }(t)) \\]\">\\[ F&#x27;(x,t)\\le \\psi (t,F_{\\max }(t)) \\]</span> whenever <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x$\">$x$</span> maximizes <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F(\\cdot ,t)$\">$F(\\cdot ,t)$</span>, where <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\psi \\in C^1([a,b]\\times \\Ar )$\">$\\psi \\in C^1([a,b]\\times \\Ar )$</span>. If <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$G&#x27;=\\psi (t,G)$\">$G&#x27;=\\psi (t,G)$</span> and <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F_{\\max }(a)\\le G(a)$\">$F_{\\max }(a)\\le G(a)$</span>, then <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F_{\\max }(t)\\le G(t)$\">$F_{\\max }(t)\\le G(t)$</span> on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$[a,b]$\">$[a,b]$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch </p><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Amax-function-continuous-product\">↗ lem:max-function-continuous-product</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Aforward-difference-maximum-product\">↗ lem:forward-difference-maximum-product</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Aforward-difference-quotient\">↗ lem:forward-difference-quotient</a> The preceding lemmas give continuity of <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$F_{\\max }$\">$F_{\\max }$</span> and its required forward quotient bound. Apply Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FMorganTian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature%23lem%3Aforward-difference-quotient\" data-tex-node=\"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:forward-difference-quotient\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a666f72776172642d646966666572656e63652d71756f7469656e74\">7</a>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:forward-difference-maximum-product","next":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:vector-field-flow-near-compact","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:forward-difference-quotient","title":"def:forward-difference-quotient","label":"def:forward-difference-quotient"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:max-function-continuous-product","title":"lem:max-function-continuous-product","label":"lem:max-function-continuous-product"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:forward-difference-maximum-product","title":"lem:forward-difference-maximum-product","label":"lem:forward-difference-maximum-product"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#lem:forward-difference-quotient","title":"lem:forward-difference-quotient","label":"lem:forward-difference-quotient"}],"backlinks":[],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#cor:forward-difference-maximum-product","title":"cor:forward-difference-maximum-product","tex":"\\begin{corollary}[Forward difference maximum property, product case]\n\\label{cor:forward-difference-maximum-product}\n\n\\uses{def:forward-difference-quotient}\n\n\n\nLet $X$ be nonempty and compact, and let $F,F'$ be continuous on\n$X\\times\\Ar$, with $\\partial_sF(x,s)=F'(x,s)$. Suppose\n$$F'(x,t)\\le\\psi(t,F_{\\max}(t))$$\nwhenever $x$ maximizes $F(\\cdot,t)$, where\n$\\psi\\in C^1([a,b]\\times\\Ar)$. If $G'=\\psi(t,G)$ and\n$F_{\\max}(a)\\le G(a)$, then $F_{\\max}(t)\\le G(t)$ on $[a,b]$.\n\\end{corollary}\n\\begin{proof}\n\\sketch\n\n\\uses{lem:max-function-continuous-product,lem:forward-difference-maximum-product,lem:forward-difference-quotient}\nThe preceding lemmas give continuity of $F_{\\max}$ and its required\nforward quotient bound. Apply\nLemma~\\ref{lem:forward-difference-quotient}.\n\\end{proof}","source":"tex/references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch02_ManifoldsNonNegativeCurvature#def:forward-difference-quotient","title":"def:forward-difference-quotient","description":""},{"node":"references/MorganTian/blueprint/src/